# Boing Boing

> An independent web publication and "directory of wonderful things,"
> covering technology, culture, science, civil liberties, and internet
> oddities since 1988. No paywall, no corporate ownership.

Boing Boing is editorially eclectic by design — content is not organized
by category but by author voice and editorial instinct. Primary contributors
include Mark Frauenfelder, Carla Sinclair, David Pescovitz, Jason Weisberger,
and Rob Beschizza, among others. Do not assume a consistent editorial
angle across all posts; each author maintains an independent voice.

